\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Decomposition of free-vocabulary consensus error rates by sentence-length tercile on development set\nobreakspace  {}$E$. Endorsement rate $e$ (errors incorrectly endorsed by peers) decreases with length, but divergence rate $d$ (correct items incorrectly flagged) increases sharply, producing net degradation of +0.356 from the shortest to the longest tercile. Under shared signature (R\_COMP-SIG), this degradation is absent.}}{9}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:complexity}{{3}{9}{Decomposition of free-vocabulary consensus error rates by sentence-length tercile on development set~$E$. Endorsement rate $e$ (errors incorrectly endorsed by peers) decreases with length, but divergence rate $d$ (correct items incorrectly flagged) increases sharply, producing net degradation of +0.356 from the shortest to the longest tercile. Under shared signature (R\_COMP-SIG), this degradation is absent}{figure.3}{}}
